      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Looarka wake bariisér múk Israeli ina haraxeér as iwa hara'ayár slaiya'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ana axaás, i kat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Heewí, mukwí muner'ín kaa óh nee slaqsa'aá munguaá hatlá', munguiiká' muu ngun gan'amisiyá' baraá tlakweema. Xáy, iqo hariínda tiwa hara'ayárí leehhi nee mukwí?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Inooín baweek, anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ a kah, Heé baraá tla/ángw múk Israeliwo oo muunaáwós ta hatsís nee slaqsa'aá munguaá hatlá', nee gari ló'wa ya/án kuwa gan'amisi nee munguiiká tleehhmaá' tlákw ngiwa tleehhi, aluuwo tari daqáy dír aarusmo as iwa hara'ayár leehhiya', anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ in mu/aywaáts, ar mu/aywatstá qoom tam dír slaqsi'ii'ín kudá' yaariire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng múk Israeli u mune kwatiít as aníng iwa i ki/iya', asma inooín taa saweés dir'eene as slaqsi'iidá' mungui ngiwa sluufmisuú ayé'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gimáy, múk Israeli baweek, Aakoó MUNGÚ i kaahi, ‹Hhu'uu'umé' nee slaqsi'iidaá munguaá hatlá' mawaak sluufmisuwo. Muruú aníng i buhhtamís mawaak tlehhtuwo.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Umuú qoomaaro, hee tam gaalá dír múk Israeliwo, laqaá dahaaymo oo yaamaá Israelír wa hoót, birta paraátl dir'eene, nee barnaxes slaqsa'aá munguaá hatlá' giri haratlintií' ar ilakaahara, nee tlakweemaaká' tari dukuutsmo dír án nee inose, aluuwo iri daqáy dír aarusmo as ngiwa xu'utír wa slai gár aníng ni kah, naagáy aníng AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, inós un mu/aywaáts. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng nee inós ti araán. Aníng inós un laya tleéhh nee slaqsaay, aníng un hingeés baraá tla/ángw xooror'eene. Diirí an didá' kawa tsaahhi adór aníng tár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Nee barnaxes aarusmoosíng kwa al/aáy gaa gari oó', daqaní anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ugwa al/aáy. Aníng dakw'eene aarusmoowí un hingeés dír muk'eé' oo Israeliwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aarusmoowí aníng u sakwasleemuút dinkwa nee heedaádá' kangw'eé' ngwa yaahasár ayi, sleémeero in dinkwaárií sakwasleemuút ar sakwasleemár wák. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí an tleéhh as múk Israeli miwa malé geexáy, tari kilooín slasla/aresiyá' ar tlakweemaaín kiwa tleehhi, as inooín tawa muk'eé' nee aníng tawa Munguúín. Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ tí aga oó'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
